            </summary>
            <p class="text-gray-300 text-xs sm:text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">
              The foul fishy odor is caused by high-heat spray drying (160°C–180°C) which scorches and oxidizes the microalgae lipids. Pure spirulina dried under sub-40°C cryo-thermal airflow retains its natural green pigment and has virtually zero fishy odor.
